{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>So that his heart not be raised above his brothers.</b> This is the reason for 'he shall not multiply silver and gold for himself.'" "<b>And so as not to turn from the commandment.</b> This is the reason for 'and it shall be with him and he shall read in it.'" "<b>So that his days be long.</b> Since rulership buries its owner, he needs something that will lengthen his days; and for this reason they say 'Long live the king' at the time they appoint a king."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:53:13.127122361Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}